{"type":"message","id":"577fb583","parentId":"17157db4","timestamp":"2026-02-01T03:25:26.251Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Build a multi-strategy paper trading system for Polymarket at /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/polymarket-copytrade/\n\n## Context\n- Existing arbitrage scanner at src/arbitrage-scanner.js polls 2000 markets every 10s via Gamma API + CLOB order books\n- Existing whale monitor at src/monitor.js tracks 9 whale wallets every 5min\n- Existing paper trader at src/paper-trader.js (basic, replace with new system)\n- PM2 processes: polymarket-arbitrage, polymarket-arb-paper, polymarket-monitor, polymarket-paper\n- Gamma API: https://gamma-api.polymarket.com/markets (no auth needed)\n- CLOB API: https://clob.polymarket.com (no auth needed)\n- Data dir: data/\n\n## Build: src/multi-strategy-paper.js (single process running all 6 strategies)\n\nEach strategy gets $1,000 starting capital. Track separately in data/strategy-state.json:\n```json\n{\n  \"strategies\": {\n    \"simple-arb\": { \"capital\": 1000, \"positions\": [], \"trades\": [], \"pnl\": 0 },\n    \"spread-tightening\": { ... },\n    \"whale-signal\": { ... },\n    \"mean-reversion\": { ... },\n    \"multi-outcome\": { ... },\n    \"momentum\": { ... }\n  },\n  \"startedAt\": \"ISO date\"\n}\n```\n\n### Strategy 1: Simple Arb\n- Every 10s scan: if best_ask_yes + best_ask_no < 0.95 on any binary market → paper buy both\n- Position size: min of $50 or available liquidity\n- Profit = (1.00 - cost) when market resolves\n- Also close if spread returns to >0.99 (early exit)\n\n### Strategy 2: Spread Tightening  \n- Same as Strategy 1 but threshold is 0.98 (buy when YES+NO < $0.98)\n- Track fees: assume 2% round-trip fee on each leg\n- Only profitable if spread < 0.96 after fees\n\n### Strategy 3: Whale Signal\n- Read data/whale-activity.jsonl for new whale trades\n- When a whale buys YES on a market, paper buy YES at current ask price within same scan\n- Position size: $25 per trade\n- Exit: sell after 24h at market price OR when 15% profit hit OR 10% stop-loss\n\n### Strategy 4: Mean Reversion\n- Track price history (store in data/price-history.json, rolling 24h window, sample every 5min)\n- When any market moves >10% in 1 hour: bet against the move (buy the opposite side)\n- Position size: $25\n- Exit: price reverts 50% of the move, OR 24h timeout, OR 15% stop-loss\n\n### Strategy 5: Multi-Outcome Underpricing\n- For markets with 3+ outcomes (group_slug grouping on Gamma API): sum all YES best_ask prices\n- If sum < 0.90: buy all outcomes proportionally\n- Position size: $50 split across all outcomes\n- Profit = (1.00 - total_cost) on resolution\n\n### Strategy 6: Momentum\n- Using same price history as Strategy 4\n- When a market moves >5% in the SAME direction over 3+ hours: follow the trend (buy the moving side)\n- Position size: $25\n- Exit: trend reversal (price moves 3% against), OR 48h timeout, OR 10% stop-loss\n\n## Price History Collection\nBuild into the same process: every 5 minutes, fetch all active markets and store mid prices in data/price-history.json. Structure:\n```json\n{\n  \"TOKEN_ID\": [\n    { \"t\": unix_timestamp, \"p\": mid_price },\n    ...\n  ]\n}\n```\nKeep only last 24h of data per token. This feeds strategies 4 and 6.\n\n## Market Resolution Tracking\n- Every hour, check if any markets in positions have resolved\n- Use Gamma API: resolved markets have `closed=true` and `resolution` field\n- Settle positions at resolution price (1.0 for winning side, 0.0 for losing)\n\n## Daily Report\n- Every 24h (or on demand), generate a summary:\n  - Each strategy: capital, open positions, closed trades, realized P&L, unrealized P&L, win rate\n  - Ranking by total return\n- Write to data/daily-report.json AND data/daily-report-latest.txt (human readable)\n\n## PM2 Setup\n- Add to ecosystem.config.cjs as `polymarket-strategies`\n- Stop old polymarket-arb-paper process (replaced by this)\n- Keep polymarket-arbitrage running (it logs opportunities that Strategy 1 & 2 consume)\n- Keep polymarket-monitor running (it logs whale activity that Strategy 3 consumes)\n\n## Trade Logging\nALL paper trades logged to data/strategy-trades.jsonl:\n```json\n{\"ts\":\"ISO\",\"strategy\":\"mean-reversion\",\"action\":\"buy\",\"market\":\"slug\",\"side\":\"YES\",\"price\":0.45,\"size\":25,\"reason\":\"10.5% drop in 1h\"}\n```\n\n## Important:\n- Use only public APIs, no authentication needed\n- No real money, paper trading only\n- Handle API errors gracefully (retry with backoff)\n- Log clearly so we can debug: `[STRATEGY_NAME] message`\n- Start all strategies immediately on launch\n- The process should be self-contained (don't import from arbitrage-scanner.js, do its own fetching)\n\nAfter building, start via PM2 and verify it runs without errors for at least 30 seconds. Show the initial log output."}],"timestamp":1769916326250}}
