{"type":"message","id":"70423645","parentId":"d2c74eec","timestamp":"2026-02-01T03:28:33.487Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Process is online, 0 restarts, 38s uptime, no errors. It's currently fetching order books for 2000 markets during price collection (which takes a while). The process is stable and running all 6 strategies.\n\n**Built and deployed `polymarket-strategies` (PM2 process #21):**\n\n- **File:** `src/multi-strategy-paper.js` — self-contained, 850+ lines\n- **6 strategies** each with $1,000 starting capital:\n  1. **Simple Arb** — buys both sides when YES+NO < $0.95, exits at >$0.99\n  2. **Spread Tightening** — threshold $0.98 with 2% fee tracking\n  3. **Whale Signal** — follows whale buys from `whale-activity.jsonl`, 15% TP / 10% SL / 24h timeout\n  4. **Mean Reversion** — bets against >10% hourly moves, exits on 50% reversion\n  5. **Multi-Outcome** — buys all outcomes when sum < $0.90\n  6. **Momentum** — follows >5% 3h+ trends, 3% reversal exit / 48h timeout\n- **Price history** collected every 5min, 24h rolling window in `data/price-history.json`\n- **Resolution tracking** hourly via Gamma API\n- **Daily reports** to `data/daily-report.json` + `data/daily-report-latest.txt`\n- **Trade logging** to `data/strategy-trades.jsonl`\n- **State persistence** in `data/strategy-state.json`\n- Stopped old `polymarket-arb-paper`, kept `polymarket-arbitrage` and `polymarket-monitor` running\n- Process stable: 38s+ uptime, 0 restarts, no errors"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":1,"output":444,"cacheRead":29732,"cacheWrite":1111,"totalTokens":31288,"cost":{"input":0.000005,"output":0.0111,"cacheRead":0.014865999999999999,"cacheWrite":0.00694375,"total":0.03291475}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1769916500433}}
